1
00:00:05,171 --> 00:00:07,711
(Penny(entering):)Hi. Did Sheldon
change the Wi-Fi password again?

2
00:00:07,924 --> 00:00:12,884
Uh, yeah, it's "Penny already eats
our food, she can pay for Wi-Fi."

3
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:16,020
(Leonard:)No spaces.

4
00:00:16,224 --> 00:00:20,524
Okay. What makes you think you
can get me to stop using your wi-Fi?

5
00:00:20,729 --> 00:00:23,309
(Sheldon:)I believe that you're capable
of great change.

6
00:00:23,523 --> 00:00:27,113
(Sheldon:)Like, when I finally got you
to stop saying "Valentime's Day."

7
00:00:28,570 --> 00:00:30,200
- Wanna hear something weird?
- Sure.

8
00:00:30,405 --> 00:00:32,115
(Sheldon:)In the year 2000...

9
00:00:32,323 --> 00:00:37,243
...Pope John Paul ll was named
an honorary Harlem Globetrotter.

10
00:00:39,372 --> 00:00:41,542
(Leonard:)What are you talking about?

11
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:44,710
(Sheldon:)You asked Penny if she wanted
to hear something weird.

12
00:00:44,919 --> 00:00:47,259
Well, yeah, because I have
something weird to tell her.

13
00:00:47,464 --> 00:00:50,754
(Sheldon:)Oh. I thought it was a game.

14
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:55,559
- What's yours?
- There's this guy, Jimmy Speckerman.

15
00:00:55,764 --> 00:00:57,934
He used to torment me
in high school.

16
00:00:58,141 --> 00:00:59,891
(Leonard:)He sent me a message
through Facebook.

17
00:01:00,101 --> 00:01:03,021
(Leonard:)- He's in town and wants to have drinks.
- Okay, Penny.

